## Review
Self-review (agent mode none) against docs/spec.md and the approved precisions. Correct: the error table, ErrorCode enum and 17 examples agree (examples-contract recomputes success results and asserts 422 cases are non-finite in float64); validation order, edge classifications, title=http.StatusText (verified with Go 1.27), non-normative detail, charset=utf-8 only, -0 normalization of operands and result, power(0,0)=1, underflow, NaN->DOMAIN_ERROR and the percentage fallback are written in openapi.yaml, spec and architecture consistently. Transport guidance covers the Go 1.22 mux pitfall (POST-only route plus /api/ catch-all yields 404 instead of 405). OpenAPI is valid with 2 known warnings (info-license: no project license chosen, recorded as debt doc-b17a3c61; operation-4xx-response on /healthz, which has no 4xx). Skills: 15 folders, 18 files, byte-identical; .gitattributes marks .claude/skills/** -text because upstream files are CRLF. Deviations from the request, all disclosed: example count is 17 not 16 (healthz added), servers url is relative '/' instead of localhost, the extra .gitattributes rule, Addy Osmani copyright taken from Forge vendor/addy-agent-skills/LICENSE. Not done by design: no backend/, frontend/, Dockerfile or CI; README sections marked 'Completed in task 4'; tasks/plan.md not created (plan lives in the Forge record). Residual risks: duplicate JSON keys are not specified (Go keeps the last value); frontend fixture import outside frontend/ may need server.fs.allow in dev, documented. No hand-maintained file exceeds 352 lines.

## Delivery
Foundation for the Sezzle calculator delivered on feat/foundation: OpenAPI 3.1 contract with 17 executable examples, spec, architecture, six ADRs, agent rules (AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md), 15 vendored skills with README and third-party notices, README skeleton and AI workflow page. Checks openapi-lint, examples-contract, line-cap and skills-copy passed under Forge. One documentation debt recorded (no project license). No application code.

## Arquitectura
- **Modelo de datos:** Request {operation, operands[]} and response {operation, operands[], result} as JSON schemas; CalculationRequest is a oneOf of binary and unary variants so arity lives in the contract (docs/api/openapi.yaml:168). Error data model: RFC 9457 Problem {type, title, status, detail, code} with a closed ErrorCode enum (openapi.yaml:218, :232). No persistence.
- **Estructuras de datos:** Planned operation registry: a hash map from id to {Arity, Apply} (docs/architecture.md:93). Example fixtures: one JSON document per case {name, request{method,path,headers,body}, response{status,contentType,body}} in docs/api/examples/. Frontend request lifecycle as a discriminated union idle|loading|success|error (docs/architecture.md:130).
- **Patrones:** Contract-first with executable fixtures shared by both test suites (ADR 0001). Strategy pattern via the operation registry; sentinel errors mapped to HTTP codes with errors.Is (docs/architecture.md:76). Layered backend: domain without HTTP, transport, wiring (ADR 0004). Problem details for errors (ADR 0002).
- **Flujo e integraciones:** Browser form -> client-side parse and arity check -> relative fetch POST /api/v1/calculations -> (Vite proxy in dev | same Go origin in container) -> middleware -> mux -> httpapi: Content-Type, 4096-byte limit, strict decode, operation, operands -> calculator.Evaluate -> normalized result or 422 -> JSON or problem+json -> UI maps code to message. Validation order is normative (openapi.yaml:54); sequence diagram in docs/architecture.md:42.
- **Contratos:** New public contract docs/api/openapi.yaml: GET /healthz (line 75) and POST /api/v1/calculations (line 92); error table with 11 codes and statuses (line 33); numeric model (line 24). Normative examples in docs/api/examples/ (17 files), usage in docs/api/README.md. No CORS; same-origin by design (ADR 0006).
- **Estado y persistencia:** Stateless service, no persistence or sessions. Repository state: .forge/changes and .forge/workflow versioned as evidence; .forge/git-workflow, graph files and .forge/tmp ignored (.gitignore). Debt register deuda tecnica/ created with doc-b17a3c61 (no project license).

